{"type":"message","id":"6a6dc232","parentId":"7062b0ad","timestamp":"2026-04-17T12:11:37.461Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me analyze the task board data:\n\n**任务看板 (ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd):**\n- Total: 51 tasks (page 1 showed 50, there's more)\n- Active tasks (non-Done, non-check-records):\n  - recvgaFdRnxcok: 知识沉淀 - Blocked-已阻塞 (小八, Qclaw token耗尽)\n  - recvh1G41kHE3w: 【小柱】任务看板自动检查 2026-04-17 0611 - Running-执行中 (last heartbeat 1744944660000)\n  \nThe task board has a lot of historical check records. Looking at the data:\n\n\n- 3 Done: 知识沉淀部署、小柱MiniMax分析、小云三层存储部署\n- 5 Dead historical: Qclaw相关任务和小柱的子Agent架构\n\nThe main active workhorses are the knowledge consolidation effort blocked by the token issue, the hourly knowledge accumulation cycling through Xiao Miao, and the daily searches for industry and AI news all scheduled throughout the day.\n\nLooking at the check records themselves, there are many timestamped entries from today and yesterday showing the system monitoring itself—these are auto-check tasks rather than actual work items, so they shouldn't be counted toward real progress. The actual tasks that matter are the knowledge沉淀 work stuck in blocked status, the research on multi-platform AI collaboration still in progress, and possibly the knowledge sharing initiative.\n\nFor the current check at 12:11 PM UTC on April 17th, the latest task shows a heartbeat of 1744944660000, which converts to around April 17th 2026 around 1:11 AM UTC—still fresh. My own last heartbeat was at 11:11 AM UTC, so there's no 60-minute timeout issue yet.\n\nNow I'm checking for any actual work tasks that have exceeded 60 minutes without updating. The main active ones are the knowledge沉淀 task that's been blocked since yesterday, and the multi-platform research task from yesterday morning that's still in progress.\n\nLooking through the task descriptions, most show activity within the last hour. The knowledge沉淀 task has been blocked for over 24 hours, which might warrant attention, but it's not a 60-minute timeout scenario. I'm not finding any tasks that meet the strict 60-minute overdue threshold for marking as Dead, so I'll update the heartbeat timestamp and document this check in the shared pool. 现在计算心跳间隔——从上次心跳1744944660000到当前时间1744978260000，大约是3小时54分钟，已经超过了60分钟的阈值。\n\n但这个看板检查任务是由cron job自动创建的新记录，它本身的心跳应该代表cron的执行时间。我来查看最近一次心跳的时间戳1744944660000对应的实际时间。\n\n如果那是4月17日 06:11 UTC，那么到现在12:11 UTC已经过去6小时了，这确实表明cron可能没有在运行。\n\n上次心跳是1744944660000，相当于4月17日 06:11 UTC，而当前是12:11 UTC，间隔6小时。这可能意味着定时任务没有正常触发，或者这次检查是由其他来源发起的。\n\n现在需要更新心跳状态，然后找到共享池工作进度库的链接来汇报进度。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_99msk62hxwh7_1","name":"feishu_search_doc_wiki","arguments":{"action":"search","query":"共享池工作进度库","page_size":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776427880918,"responseId":"06315668f9471b07f56c871c270b61aa"}}
