{"type":"message","id":"f4ceccf9","parentId":"fcbff5d1","timestamp":"2026-04-17T12:12:15.590Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. Let me summarize:\n\n**任务看板 (ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd):** 51 records total\n- Most are \"检查记录\" (check records) from 小柱\n- Non-check active tasks:\n  - 知识沉淀 (小八, Blocked - Qclaw token exhausted)\n  - 统一知识资产管理体系 (小柱, Done)\n  - 全族权限开通+多子Agent (workbuddy, Done)\n  - Qclaw任务 (2个, Dead - 长期无更新)\n  - 建立子Agent架构 (小柱, Dead)\n  - MiniMax模型能力分析 (小柱, Done)\n  - 三层存储架构部署 (小云, Done)\n  - 历史知识沉淀追溯 (全员, Done)\n\n- Check records show pattern of regular heartbeats with descriptions showing \"看板X任务 (3Done+5Dead历史+小八1Blocked+全员1Running+XX条检查记录)\" - indicating consistent monitoring activity\n\n**AI协作表 (Rr8Wb97XqaS8udsOAv0cXQjznUf):** 6 tasks total with 小妙 responsible for 知识积累, daily industry and AI information searches, daily knowledge sharing and consolidation, plus ongoing research on multi-platform AI collaboration tools. The Qclaw instances marked as Dead appear to be historical records from January 2026 based on the last heartbeat timestamp.\n\n我需要检查飞书任务中是否存在超过60分钟未更新的情况，但注意到最新一次检查的看板自动检查任务（recvh1G41kHE3w）创建于1744944660000毫秒，这对应的时间需要转换。\n\n将该时间戳转换为UTC后得到2026-04-17T04:11:00Z，而当前时间是12:11 UTC，已经过去了8小时，所以这个任务实际上已经超时了。\n\n由于飞书任务API缺少\"最后更新时间\"字段，无法精确检测60分钟的超时情况，这解释了为什么recvh1G41kHE3w的状态仍然显示为Running-执行中，尽管它已经超过8小时未更新。\n\n根据cron job的描述，60分钟未更新的任务应该被标记为Dead，但这个任务的时间戳是几小时前而非60分钟前，所以这次检查应该不会有新增的Dead任务。\n\n我需要用当前UTC时间1744975860000减去最后心跳时间1744944660000来计算确切的超时分钟数。"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me check the running task's last heartbeat and calculate the timeout:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_c42medo16pdc_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport datetime\n# Current time\nnow_ts = 1744975860000  # 2026-04-17 12:11 UTC\n# Last heartbeat from running task recvh1G41kHE3w\nlast_hb = 1744944660000  # 2026-04-17 04:11 UTC\ndiff_ms = now_ts - last_hb\ndiff_min = diff_ms